    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "73rd Constitutional Amendment Act added Part IX and the 11th Schedule (29 functional items) to the Constitution.",
        "Gram Sabha is a permanent body comprising all persons registered in the electoral rolls of a village within the Panchayat area.",
        "The three tiers are mandatory for states with a population exceeding 20 lakhs: Gram Panchayat (Village), Panchayat Samiti (Block), and Zila Parishad (District)."
      ],
      "id": "vw0s8tw"
